; Probe for tests/tools/Record16MenuGolden.py: EasyUO 1.6 MENU golden values.
; "menu reforge mode 1.6" makes Reforged run it under the 1.6 logic; 1.6 ignores the line.
; Which lines create a control: too few words, a non-number where an integer is
; needed, a negative where 1.6 wants a cardinal, an invalid colour. A control that
; exists answers "getprop left"; one that does not leaves Q.
;@wait A
menu reforge mode 1.6
set #lpc 1000
menu window size 400 300
menu text v01 a 1 hi
menu text v02 1 1
menu text v03 -5 -6 hi
menu button v04 1 1 -1 20 x
menu button v05 a 1 10 10 x
menu button v06 1 1 10 10
menu button v07 1 1 10 a x
menu edit v08 1 1 -1 x
menu edit v09 1 1 10
menu edit v10 1 b 10 x
menu check v11 1 1 10 10 a x
menu check v12 1 1 10 10 1
menu check v13 1 1 -10 10 1 x
menu radio v14 1 1 10 10 a x
menu radio v15 1 1 10 10 1
menu list create v16 1 1 -10 10
menu list create v17 1 1 10
menu combo create v18 1 1 -10
menu combo create v19 1 1
menu image create v20 1 1 -10 10
menu image create v21 1 1 10
menu form v22 a 1 10 10
menu setdef parent form0
menu form v23 1 1 10
menu setdef parent form0
menu panel v24 1 1 -10 -10
menu setdef parent form0
menu panel v25 1 1 10
menu setdef parent form0
menu shape v26 1 1 -10 10 3 1 1 0 7 255
menu shape v27 1 1 10 10 3 1 1 red 7 255
menu shape v28 1 1 10 10 3 1 1 0 7
menu shape v29 1 1 10 10 3 1 -1 0 7 255
menu shape v30 1 1 10 10 3 1 1 0 -7 255
menu text v31 1.5 1 hi
menu text v32 +3 4 hi
menu form v33 1 1 -10 -10 neg
menu setdef parent form0
menu image create v34 1 1 0 0
menu button v35 1 1 0 0 x
set #menures Q
menu getprop v01 left
set %r V01= , #menures
set #menures Q
menu getprop v02 left
set %r %r , _V02= , #menures
set #menures Q
